sed 's/pattern/replacement_string/' file

sed 's/pattern/replacement_string/g' file --> for the global replacement of the string in file
---------------
sed 's/text/replace' file > newfile

mv newfile file

sed -i 's/text/replace' file

sed -i 's:text:replace' file

or 

sed -i 's|text|replace|g' file

the delimiter can be / , : , | 
